  "intro": {
    "text": "Some verbs take `-(I)n` for an action done to yourself: *yıkanmak* (to have a wash), *giyinmek* (to get dressed), *hazırlanmak* (to get ready). For everything else, use *kendi* with a possessive and a case: *Aynada kendime baktım* (I looked at myself in the mirror).",
    "see": "gp-reflexive"
  },
